    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even if it's just \"relief,\" isn't that just a temporary delay? it feels like i'm just prolonging the inevitable. if my destiny is already set by my blood, then every day i spend fighting it feels like an exercise in futility. why keep struggling against something that's going to happen anyway?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
